ID  - arxiv-1204.5807v1
AU  - ANDRUSKIEWITSCH, N.
AU  - ANGIONO, I.
AU  - IGLESIAS, A. GARCÍA
TI  - FROM HOPF ALGEBRAS TO TENSOR CATEGORIES
DA  - D:20180521
UR  - https://arxiv.org/abs/1204.5807
AB  - This is a survey on spherical Hopf algebras. We give criteria to decide when a Hopf algebra is spherical and collect examples. We discuss tilting modules as a mean to obtain a fusion subcategory of the non-degenerate quotient of the category of representations of a suitable Hopf algebra.
ER  - 
